  "note": "Constants checked. [Tru, Thm 1] (arXiv:1206.1844v2) gives, for primitive nonprincipal χ and T ≥ 1, |N(T,χ) − (T/π)log(qT/2πe)| ≤ 0.315 log qT + 6.455, with N counting zeros with 0 < β < 1 and |γ| ≤ T. This implies g_χ = 0.5 log qT + 17.7."
